      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h2 id=\"publicera-en-videoström-med-uas-tool\"><a href=\"#publicera-en-videoström-med-uas-tool\">Publicera en videoström med UAS Tool.</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Öppna Deploy App - MTX",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Öppna Deploy App MTX</li>\n<li>Välj \"+ Lägg till\"</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX - Starta en ström 1",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Öppna UAS Tool-rullgardinsmenyn</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/6c688161563357e5.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2007
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX - Starta en ström 2",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Välj \"Import settings to UAS Tool\"</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/86295a5913b3135d.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 1997
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "ATAK - Importera inställningar",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>\"Would you like to apply the configuration from an external source?\"</li>\n<li>Välj \"Yes\"</li>\n<li>Navigera till UAS Tool-pluginen</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/cd929600c74f69be.webp",
              "width": 2109,
              "height": 994
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "UAS Tool Streaming 1",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Välj din drönare med \"Uppspelnings\"-knappen</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/ba41b55607516e35.webp",
              "width": 2106,
              "height": 995
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "UAS Tool Streaming 2",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>För att strömma, välj \"Wrench\"-knappen för inställningar</li>\n<li>Tryck på \"((Uppspelnings))\" -knappen för att starta sändningen</li>\n<li>Du bör få en \"Broadcast started\" notis</li>\n<li>För att avsluta strömmen trycker du på \"((Uppspelnings))\" knappen igen</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/07df05ce5332df04.webp",
              "width": 2106,
              "height": 995
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Nu vet du hur man startar en ström",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Du kan stänga denna guide.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
